flowchart LR
    A[Process] -->|"write(fd, buf, 8192)"| B[System Call]
    B --> C[VFS Layer]
    C --> D[Page Cache]
    
    D --> E{Write Mode}
    E -->|Buffered Write default| F[Copy to page cache]
    E -->|O_DIRECT| G[Bypass cache]
    E -->|O_SYNC| H[Write-through]
    
    F --> F1[Mark pages dirty]
    F1 --> F2[Return immediately]
    F2 --> F3[pdflush writes later]
    F3 --> I[Block Device]
    
    G --> I
    H --> I
    
    I --> J[Disk Write]
    
    K[Read Operation] --> L["read(fd, buf, 4096)"]
    L --> M[Check Page Cache]
    M --> N{In Cache?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Return from cache - fast!]
    N -->|No| P[Read from disk]
    P --> Q[Populate cache]
    Q --> R[Return to user]
    
    style F fill:#e8f5e8
    style O fill:#d4edda
    style P fill:#fff4e1
